Description: GPU loader policy, NVIDIA open modules on the kernel-pve pair
 Loader-policy-only deb (no module file): it ships the modprobe policy of
 the {{ SET }}+NVIDIA profile and pins the linux-modules-nvidia-pve pair
 built against the kernel-pve packaging of this repo. The in-tree
 (daemoncores-kernel) sets of debian-bootc play no role here; the deb
 conflicts with its debian-tree counterpart over the modprobe policy it
 ships for one profile.